  <Strings>
    <Section>entry</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>897</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>19000023</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>やっぱり……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Você não estava brincando...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>0</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>944</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>19000024</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>な、涼しくて最高だろ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Viu? Tá uma maravilha, né?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>988</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>19000025</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>そうだネ！
この水路もどこかに
つながってるみたいだし。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Com certeza! Parece que esse
canal leva a algum lugar também.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1031</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>19000026</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ここは一体……？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Mas o que é isso?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1111</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>19000027</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>カレーズです。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Isto é um Karez.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>0</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1225</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>19000028</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>カレーズ？
なんだそりゃ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Karez? O que é isso?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1268</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>19000029</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>カレーズか……
それなら&lt;Tytree&gt;のお手柄だな。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Karez, então... Se você estiver
certa, é melhor agradecermos
a &lt;Tytree&gt;.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1343</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>1900002a</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……ええ。この水路をたどって行けば、
砂漠越えより安全かもしれません。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Sim. Provavelmente seria mais
seguro seguir estes canais, em vez
de atravessar o deserto.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>0</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1476</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>1900002b</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>おいおい。
二人で仲良く納得してないで
おれたちにも教えてくれよ。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ei, vocês dois parecem se dar bem,
mas dá pra deixar o resto de nós
a par também?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1526</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>1900002c</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;scale:120&gt;別に仲良くなんてしてません！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Nós &lt;Italic&gt;NÃO&lt;/Italic&gt; estamos nos dando bem!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>0</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1555</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>1900002d</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……&lt;Annie&gt;。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...&lt;Annie&gt;.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1616</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>1900002e</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>なんだよ？　そんなに必死こいて
否定しなくてもイイじゃねーか。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Qual é o seu problema? Não precisa
se estressar tanto por isso.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1685</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>1900002f</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……カレーズとは、
地下水路の事だ。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Esses canais subterrâneos
são conhecidos como Karez.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1756</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>19000030</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>誰かが造ったものなの？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Foram feitos por pessoas?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1796</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>19000031</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>昔の人たちが、井戸と井戸を
地下でつなげて水路にしたもので、
砂漠の街では命の水脈なの。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Antigamente, as pessoas ligavam
poços para criar canais assim sob
a terra. São a fonte de vida de
qualquer cidade do deserto.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>0</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1880</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>19000032</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Tytree&gt;のお手柄とは
どういう意味だ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Então o que quis dizer com
agradecer a &lt;Tytree&gt;?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1917</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>19000033</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>水路なら、人のいる場所に
通じている可能性が高い
という事です。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Como isto é um canal, é muito
provável que leve a um lugar
onde há gente.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>0</SpeakerId>
      <Id>20</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1953</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>19000034</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>そっか♪　必要じゃない場所に
わざわざ水路なんか引かないもんね。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ah, é! Ninguém ia se dar ao
trabalho de fazer algo assim se
não morasse por perto, né?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1981</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>19000035</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……って事は……この中を
歩いて行けばイイんだな？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Então a gente deve
explorar, né?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>22</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2020</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>19000036</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>方角も合ってるみたいだし、
どこまで行けるかわからないけど
砂漠を歩くよりはましね。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Parece que isso vai nos levar na
direção certa. Mesmo sem saber até
onde vai, é melhor que o deserto.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>23</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2055</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>19000037</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ただ、この先に
何があるかはわからない。
充分、注意して進むんだ。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Porém, ainda pode haver perigo
adiante. Não baixem a guarda.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>24</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2091</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>19000038</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>よっしゃ!!
行けるとこまで行こうぜ!!</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Beleza!! Vamos até onde isso
nos levar!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>25</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
  </Strings>
